+        ``z`` ``(B, T, D)`` level-1 states, ``a`` ``(B, T - 1, 2)`` the level-1 actions in WM units. Returns ``loss`` and ``diag`` (detached: ``rsp_g_aa``, ``rsp_g_ww``, ``rsp_g_aw``, ``rsp_g_wa``, ``rsp_s_a``, ``rsp_s_w``)."""
